00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:28.260
Notpower and Tesla have formed a partnership valued at $4 to $5 billion to install battery

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.380
storage infrastructure in the UK and Italy.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:39.680
Phase 1 targets 25 gigawatt hours across 5 projects, with a longer term aim of 100 gigawatt

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.040
