00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:46.080
The deal relies on Tesla MegaPak hardware and its trading software to decide when to charge

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:46.660
and discharge.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:53.200
Over 20 years, the projects are projected to generate more than $15 billion in revenue.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:58.160
The initiative is intended to help balance power grids that are adding more wind and

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.120
solar capacity.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:04.860
Tesla's trading software will be used to optimize when stored energy is bought and sold

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:05.900
on local markets.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:11.920
The project's aim to support grid stability as renewable generation grows in both countries.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:21.100
Tesla filed a US trademark application for the name Megapod under serial number 99893717.

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:26.580
The filing list Tesla incorporated at its Austin address as the applicant.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:33.460
The move aligns with the company growing focus on large-scale energy storage and AI infrastructure

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:33.900
needs.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.900
No public details on the product itself have been released yet.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:43.580
The application comes as the company expands both Megapak production and data center-related

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:44.280
