00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.580
Observers see it as another indicator that Tesla is preparing infrastructure for higher

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.500
AI training and inference loads.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.360
Tesla has begun showing in-car celebrations when drivers reach certain milestones without

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.780
